<title>SINGAPORE: Singapore bunker final report and prices - June 10.</title>
<headline>Singapore bunker final report and prices - June 10.</headline>
<text>
<p>(DELIVERED U.S.$/TONNE)  380 CST  180 CST    MDO    GAS OIL</p>
<p> SINGAPORE CARGO	   94/95    101/102    UNQ    170/173</p>
<p> SINGAPORE BUNKER	  96/98    102/104  188/190  196/198</p>
<p>--------</p>
<p>COMMENTS - Singapore bunker quotes softened slightly on Tuesday amid poor demand, traders said. Some shipowners asked for very low levels, but suppliers stayed on the sidelines and were unwilling to make offers.</p>
<p>-- Singapore Newsroom (65-870-3571)</p>
